note Drag the splitter on a panel's centre side to resize it; the cursor shows the resize arrows while hovering or dragging. The size is clamped so the centre keeps a minimum and every panel after it on the same edge keeps its own minimum. The size lasts until the panel moves between a side and the bottom, and is not saved.

